- [ ] Task 1: Define module-level constants for Strongman geometry (mallet, puck, lever, tower, bell) and helper function anchors inside the TODO anchor for module state - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 2: Implement the mallet swing logic using SpawnDynamicCapsule for the mallet body and ApplyImpulse on release, registering the swing timer and detecting player input via MidwayInput.IsActionDown("fire") - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 3: Spawn the puck using SpawnDynamicSphere and the lever using SpawnStaticCapsule, configure friction and restitution via SetFriction and SetRestitution, and lock Z-translation and X/Y rotation via DOF constraints - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 4: Implement the tower and bell using SpawnStaticCylinder and SpawnStaticSphere, add the "Rusty Rails" variable friction modifier by reading AttractionConstants.modifiers inside OnStep and applying SetFriction to the puck - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 5: Create an object pool for pucks using MidwayPhysics.CreatePool, implement PoolAcquire on puck spawn, PoolReturn on successful ring, and PoolCullBelow to remove pucks that fall below a threshold - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 6: Implement the "Bell's Curse" shifting mechanic by moving the bell position with MoveKinematic or adjusting SpawnStaticSphere coordinates based on AttractionConstants.modifiers inside OnStep - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 7: Implement the "Cracked Base" wobble by applying a sinusoidal offset to the platform spawn position using MoveKinematic on a kinematic base object, reading the wobble amplitude from AttractionConstants.modifiers - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 8: Implement the scoring logic that checks if the puck reaches the bell, awards Tickets via Engine.AwardTickets(n, label) on success, and handles the Streak Protocol by multiplying the award with Engine.GetStreak() - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 9: Implement the "Echo Strikes" rhythm mechanic by tracking consecutive hits on the same spot, increasing tension via SetMass or SetLinearDamping adjustments, and resetting progress on miss - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 10: Implement the "Sabotaged Mallet" splintering logic by reducing mallet mass via SetMass after a hit, destroying the mallet body with DestroyBody when mass drops below threshold, and spawning a new mallet from the pool - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 11: Implement the "Shock Plates" hazard by spawning SpawnSensorBox on the platform, checking IsSensorTriggered(handle) inside OnStep, and applying a penalty to tokens via Engine.AwardTokens(-n, label) if triggered - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 12: Implement the "Tower Gauge Shift" mechanic by destroying the current puck with DestroyBody and spawning a new puck at a random height using PoolAcquire or SpawnDynamicSphere based on AttractionConstants.modifiers - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua
- [ ] Task 13: Implement the OnUnload hook to print diagnostics only, ensuring no gameplay logic remains, and verify that all pools are reclaimed automatically by the engine - attractions/strongman/strongman.lua  [Telemetry] Blueprint Generation (round 1) (qwen3.5:9b)  TTFT: 84.99s | Speed: 6.1 tok/s (365 TPM) | Effective: 3.5 tok/s
